WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.769
An ATM visit can follow a short routine.

2
00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:06.577
Choose a machine in a bright public place, if possible.

3
00:00:06.577 --> 00:00:10.869
Check that nobody is standing too close. Keep your card ready.

4
00:00:10.869 --> 00:00:14.331
Cover the keypad while you enter your private PIN.

5
00:00:14.331 --> 00:00:18.554
Follow one screen at a time. Cancel if something feels wrong.

6
00:00:18.554 --> 00:00:21.600
Take your card and cash before walking away.

7
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:27.600
Keep your PIN secret. Ask official bank staff for help if needed.
